 in Summit County has a record from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw June to July at 56% of normal and October to November at 59%. This year so far, March to April 2026 sat at 56% on the middle, and a preliminary estimate for grid 23195 puts July to August 2026 at 85.7.</p>"}
